    "Ledger unavailable" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"帳簿を開けません"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"장부를 열 수 없음"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"账本暂时无法打开"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"帳本暫時無法開啟"}}}},
    "Local Entries" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"端末内の件数"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"로컬 내역"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本机记录"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本機記錄"}}}},
    "Made locally with MiniBill" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"MiniBillで端末内生成"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"MiniBill에서 로컬로 생성"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"由 MiniBill 在本机生成"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"由 MiniBill 在本機產生"}}}},
    "Me" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"自分"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"나"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"我的"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"我的"}}}},
    "MiniBill schedules reminders on this device. Delivery can be affected by system notification settings, Focus, or power state." : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"MiniBillはこの端末にリマインダーを予約します。通知設定、集中モード、電源状態により届かない場合があります。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"MiniBill은 이 기기에 알림을 예약합니다. 시스템 알림 설정, 집중 모드 또는 전원 상태의 영향을 받을 수 있습니다."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"MiniBill 会在本机预先排程提醒。系统通知设置、专注模式或设备电源状态可能影响送达。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"MiniBill 會在本機預先排程提醒。系統通知設定、專注模式或裝置電源狀態可能影響送達。"}}}},
    "Month-end Reminder" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"月末リマインダー"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"월말 알림"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"月末结账提醒"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"月底結算提醒"}}}},
    "Month-end review" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"月末の確認"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"월말 검토"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"月末结账"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"月底結算"}}}},
    "Month-end Time" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"月末の時刻"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"월말 시간"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"月末时间"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"月底時間"}}}},
    "MONTHLY" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"月次"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"월간"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"月度"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"月度"}}}},
    "Net Profit" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"純利益"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"순이익"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"净收益"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"淨收益"}}}},
    "No entries this month" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"今月の記録はありません"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이번 달 내역 없음"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本月暂无流水"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本月暫無流水"}}}},
    "No entries yet" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"記録はまだありません"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"아직 내역이 없습니다"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"还没有流水"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"還沒有流水"}}}},
    "No matching entries" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"該当する記録はありません"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"일치하는 내역이 없습니다"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"暂无匹配流水"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"暫無符合的流水"}}}},
    "No project data" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"項目データはありません"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"프로젝트 데이터 없음"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"暂无项目数据"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"暫無項目資料"}}}},
    "Note and Date" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"メモと日付"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"메모 및 날짜"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"备注与日期"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"備註與日期"}}}},
    "Note must be 200 characters or fewer." : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"メモは200文字以内にしてください。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"메모는 200자 이하여야 합니다."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"备注不能超过 200 个字符。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"備註不能超過 200 個字元。"}}}},
    "OK" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OK"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"확인"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"确定"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"確定"}}}},
    "Offline bookkeeping for small businesses and side work." : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"小規模ビジネスと副業のためのオフライン帳簿。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"소규모 사업과 부업을 위한 오프라인 장부."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"为小生意和副业打造的离线记账工具。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"為小生意與副業打造的離線記帳工具。"}}}},
    "Open Share Sheet" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"共有シートを開く"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"공유 시트 열기"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"打开系统分享"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"開啟系統分享"}}}},
    "Open System Settings" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"システム設定を開く"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"시스템 설정 열기"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"前往系统设置"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"前往系統設定"}}}},
    "Opens monthly statistics" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"月間統計を開きます"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"월간 통계를 엽니다"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"打开月度统计"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"開啟月度統計"}}}},
    "Optional note" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"任意のメモ"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"선택 메모"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"选填备注"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"選填備註"}}}},
    "Privacy" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"プライバシー"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"개인정보 보호"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"隐私说明"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"隱私說明"}}}},
    "Project Name" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"項目名"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"프로젝트 이름"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"项目名称"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"項目名稱"}}}},
    "Project name is required." : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"項目名を入力してください。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"프로젝트 이름은 필수입니다."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"项目名称为必填项。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"項目名稱為必填項目。"}}}},
    "Reminders" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"リマインダー"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"알림"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"提醒"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"提醒"}}}},
    "Replace and Restore" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"置き換えて復元"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"교체 후 복원"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"替换并恢复"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"取代並回復"}}}},
    "Replace the current ledger?" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"現在の帳簿を置き換えますか？"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"현재 장부를 교체할까요?"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"替换当前账本？"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"取代目前帳本？"}}}},
    "Restore failed. Your original ledger was not changed." : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"復元できませんでした。元の帳簿は変更されていません。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"복원하지 못했습니다. 기존 장부는 변경되지 않았습니다."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"恢复失败，原有记录未改变。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"回復失敗，原有記錄未有變更。"}}}},
    "Restore from Backup" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"バックアップから復元"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"백업에서 복원"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"从备份恢复"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"從備份回復"}}}},
    "Restore Preview" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"復元プレビュー"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"복원 미리보기"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"恢复预览"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"回復預覽"}}}},
    "Restore replaces the entire local ledger. It does not merge entries." : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"復元は端末内の帳簿全体を置き換えます。記録の結合は行いません。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"복원은 로컬 장부 전체를 교체하며 내역을 병합하지 않습니다."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"恢复会完整替换本机账本，不会合并流水。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"回復會完整取代本機帳本，不會合併流水。"}}}},
    "Review this month's income and expenses in MiniBill." : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"MiniBillで今月の収入と支出を確認しましょう。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"MiniBill에서 이번 달 수입과 지출을 확인하세요."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在 MiniBill 中核对本月收支。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在 MiniBill 中核對本月收支。"}}}},
    "Save" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"保存"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"저장"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"保存"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"儲存"}}}},
    "Saving…" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"保存中…"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"저장 중…"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在保存…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在儲存…"}}}},
    "Simple offline bills, effortless bookkeeping for small business" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"シンプルなオフライン帳簿、小さな商いを手軽に記録"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"간결한 오프라인 장부, 작은 사업을 손쉽게 기록"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"极简离线账单，小生意随手记"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"極簡離線帳單，小生意隨手記"}}}},
    "Share Entry" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"記録を共有"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"내역 공유"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"分享这笔流水"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"分享這筆流水"}}}},
    "Share Month" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"月次結果を共有"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"월간 결과 공유"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"分享月度收益"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"分享月度收益"}}}},
    "Share Preview" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"共有プレビュー"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"공유 미리보기"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"分享预览"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"分享預覽"}}}},
    "Shows entries for this day" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"この日の記録を表示します"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이 날짜의 내역을 표시합니다"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"查看当天流水"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"查看當天流水"}}}},
    "Shows entries for this project" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"この項目の記録を表示します"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이 프로젝트의 내역을 표시합니다"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"查看该项目流水"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"查看該項目流水"}}}},
    "Statistics" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"統計"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"통계"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"统计"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"統計"}}}},
    "System App Language" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"システムのアプリ言語"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"시스템 앱 언어"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"系统级 App 语言"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"系統層級 App 語言"}}}},
    "System notifications are off. Your reminder preference is preserved." : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"システム通知がオフです。リマインダー設定は保持されています。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"시스템 알림이 꺼져 있습니다. 알림 설정은 유지됩니다."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"系统通知已关闭，提醒偏好仍会保留。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"系統通知已關閉，提醒偏好仍會保留。"}}}},
    "Take a moment to record today's income and expenses." : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"今日の収入と支出を記録しましょう。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"오늘의 수입과 지출을 기록해 보세요."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"花一点时间记录今天的收入和支出。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"花一點時間記錄今天的收入與支出。"}}}},
    "Tap Add Entry to record income or expense." : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"「記録を追加」から収入または支出を記録できます。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"내역 추가를 눌러 수입 또는 지출을 기록하세요."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"点击“记一笔”记录收入或支出。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"點一下「記一筆」記錄收入或支出。"}}}},
    "This backup could not be read. Your ledger was not changed." : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"バックアップを読み取れません。帳簿は変更されていません。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"백업을 읽을 수 없습니다. 장부는 변경되지 않았습니다."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"无法读取此备份，账本未发生改变。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"無法讀取此備份，帳本未有變更。"}}}},
    "This backup is damaged or invalid. Your ledger was not changed." : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"バックアップが破損しているか無効です。帳簿は変更されていません。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"백업이 손상되었거나 유효하지 않습니다. 장부는 변경되지 않았습니다."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"备份已损坏或无效，账本未发生改变。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"備份已損毀或無效，帳本未有變更。"}}}},
    "This backup is empty. Restoring it will erase every current entry." : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"このバックアップは空です。復元すると現在の記録がすべて消去されます。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이 백업은 비어 있습니다. 복원하면 현재 모든 내역이 삭제됩니다."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"此备份为空，恢复后会清空当前所有流水。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"此備份是空的，回復後會清除目前所有流水。"}}}},
    "This backup needs a newer version of MiniBill. Your ledger was not changed." : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"このバックアップには新しいMiniBillが必要です。帳簿は変更されていません。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이 백업에는 더 최신 MiniBill이 필요합니다. 장부는 변경되지 않았습니다."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"此备份需要更新版本的 MiniBill，账本未发生改变。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"此備份需要較新版本的 MiniBill，帳本未有變更。"}}}},
    "Today" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"今日"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"오늘"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"今天"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"今天"}}}},
    "Top Expense" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"支出トップ"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"최고 지출"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"支出 TOP 1"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"支出 TOP 1"}}}},
    "Top Income" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"収入トップ"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"최고 수입"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"收入 TOP 1"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"收入 TOP 1"}}}},
    "Try Again" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"もう一度試す"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"다시 시도"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"重试"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"再試一次"}}}},
    "Type" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"種類"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"유형"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"类型"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"類型"}}}},
    "What was this for?" : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"何の項目ですか？"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"어떤 항목인가요?"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"这笔是什么项目？"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"這筆是甚麼項目？"}}}},
    "MiniBill stores ledger entries only on this device. It has no account, analytics, advertising, cloud sync, or network dependency." : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"MiniBillは帳簿データをこの端末だけに保存します。アカウント、分析、広告、クラウド同期、ネットワーク依存はありません。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"MiniBill은 장부 내역을 이 기기에만 저장합니다. 계정, 분석, 광고, 클라우드 동기화 또는 네트워크 의존성이 없습니다."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"MiniBill 仅在本机保存流水，不含账户、分析、广告、云同步或网络依赖。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"MiniBill 只在本機儲存流水，不含帳戶、分析、廣告、雲端同步或網路依賴。"}}}},
    "Share images are generated locally and never include notes. Backup files are not encrypted." : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"共有画像は端末内で生成され、メモは含まれません。バックアップは暗号化されません。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"공유 이미지는 기기에서 생성되며 메모를 포함하지 않습니다. 백업 파일은 암호화되지 않습니다."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"分享图在本机生成且永不包含备注；备份文件未加密。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"分享圖片在本機產生且絕不包含備註；備份檔案未加密。"}}}},
    "Deleting MiniBill removes its local ledger and scheduled notifications from this device." : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"MiniBillを削除すると、この端末の帳簿と予約済み通知も削除されます。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"MiniBill을 삭제하면 이 기기의 로컬 장부와 예약된 알림도 삭제됩니다."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"卸载 MiniBill 会删除本机账本与已排程通知。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"解除安裝 MiniBill 會刪除本機帳本與已排程通知。"}}}},
    "Your existing ledger was not changed. Try opening it again." : {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"既存の帳簿は変更されていません。もう一度開いてください。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"기존 장부는 변경되지 않았습니다. 다시 열어 보세요."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"原有账本未发生改变，请重试打开。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"原有帳本未有變更，請再試一次開啟。"}}}}
  },
  "version" : "1.0"
}
